---
system: sys-07-parent-controls-summary
flow_id: dst-rebuild
surface: cron
spec_anchor: /software/systems/07-parent-controls-summary#dst-rebuild-trigger
actors: [EventBridge, ControlsService, PostgreSQL, ConfigService]
apis: []
externals: [EventBridge]
queues: []
failure_paths:
  - invalid_timezone
  - config_rebuild_partial_failure
  - no_dst_transition_detected
idempotency: per-timezone offset diff check; rebuild only when today's UTC offset differs from yesterday's
retry: ConfigService rebuilds queued individually; per-device failures don't abort run
timeout: 600s per timezone batch
status: final
---
%% HAND-CURATED. DST/timezone transition cron — rebuilds quiet-hours config blobs only when offset shifts.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant EventBridge
    participant ControlsService
    participant PostgreSQL
    participant ConfigService

    EventBridge->>ControlsService: cron(0 0 * * ? *) (daily 00:00 UTC)
    ControlsService->>PostgreSQL: SELECT DISTINCT timezone FROM parent_controls WHERE quiet_hours_enabled=true

    loop per timezone
        ControlsService->>ControlsService: compute today UTC offset vs yesterday UTC offset
        alt invalid_timezone
            Note over ControlsService: fail-open — skip timezone — emit metric controls_invalid_tz_total
        else no_dst_transition_detected
            Note over ControlsService: offsets equal — skip
        else dst_transition
            ControlsService->>PostgreSQL: SELECT device_ids in this timezone
            loop per device in timezone
                ControlsService->>ConfigService: rebuildConfig(deviceId)
                alt config_rebuild_partial_failure
                    ConfigService-->>ControlsService: error
                    Note over ControlsService: log and continue (reconciliation cron picks up stale)
                else rebuilt
                    ConfigService-->>ControlsService: ok (new config_version)
                end
            end
        end
    end

    Note over EventBridge,ConfigService: also triggered ad-hoc on household.timezone_changed event from sys-01 — quiet_hours times NOT auto-adjusted
